	// Impressions of Paula
	impression: "Heels, glitter and exhaustion. She looks like she danced through a hurricane and is still standing."
	impression: "She talks about her daughter all the time. The work, the trip, every deal: it's all to get back to her."
	impression: "Her laugh fills the whole car. Then she goes quiet, staring at her phone. And she's back to reality."
